indications_limitations:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B. Nationally Covered Indications&lt;&sol;p&gt;&lt;&sol;strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The confirmatory analyses were not published during the 24-month time period. Therefore, effective December 15, 2017, CMS determines that there are no nationally covered indications for PET NaF-18.&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C. Nationally Non-Covered Indications&lt;&sol;p&gt;&lt;&sol;strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective December 15, 2017, CMS determines that PET NaF-18 PET is nationally non-covered.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D. Other&lt;&sol;p&gt;&lt;&sol;strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other PET radiopharmaceutical tracers for cancer can be covered at local Medicare Administrative Contractor discretion when used according to their FDA-approved indication(s).&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(This NCD last reviewed December 2017.)&lt;&sol;p&gt;

