&lt;p&gt;      03&sol;2010 - CMS proposes that the evidence is not sufficient to determine that the results of NaF-18 PET imaging to identify bone metastases improve health outcomes of beneficiaries with cancer. Therefore CMS proposes that this use is not reasonable and necessary under Section 1862(a)(1)(A) of the Social Security Act (the Act). Effective date: 02&sol;26&sol;2010. Implementation date: 07&sol;06&sol;2010. (&lt;a href=&quot;https:&sol;&sol;www.cms.gov&sol;Regulations-and-Guidance&sol;Guidance&sol;Transmittals&sol;Downloads&sol;R119NCD.pdf&quot;&gt;TN 119&lt;&sol;a&gt;) (CR6861)&lt;&sol;p&gt;
